                      , `the Family Court thinks fit to require such security` IS FALSE
                      , `the administrator is entitled to the whole of the estate after payment of the debts` IS FALSE
                      , `the amount at which the estate within the jurisdiction is sworn` IS 400000
                      , `debts due by the deceased secured by mortgage` IS 150000
                      , `such security as he is lawfully required to furnish has been given` IS FALSE
                      , `date of death of the last surviving executor or administrator` IS NOTHING
                      , `an application for the representation of the estate has been made since that death` IS FALSE
